<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Playboy Love</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Eem Triplin</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">No More Tears</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">2JDcvLJ2x9rSImrf86n38X</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:02.944" end="00:06.195" ttm:agent="v1">Prod by Eem Triplin</p>
      <p begin="00:06.195" end="00:10.445" ttm:agent="v1">When are we go understand that we are put on earth</p>
      <p begin="00:10.445" end="00:12.444" ttm:agent="v1">to love</p>
      <p begin="00:12.444" end="00:14.195" ttm:agent="v1">That is all it about</p>
      <p begin="00:14.195" end="00:17.195" ttm:agent="v1">Everybody wanna figure out how complicated life is</p>
      <p begin="00:17.195" end="00:18.695" ttm:agent="v1">and break it down</p>
      <p begin="00:18.445" end="00:20.444" ttm:agent="v1">This is what I truly think</p>
      <p begin="00:20.444" end="00:21.945" ttm:agent="v1">I really think that</p>
      <p begin="00:21.945" end="00:23.445" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:22.694" end="00:25.694" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:25.694" end="00:28.694" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:28.694" end="00:31.444" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:31.444" end="00:33.945" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:33.945" end="00:36.445" ttm:agent="v1">说实话 回答他 没进沙</p>
      <p begin="00:36.445" end="00:38.695" ttm:agent="v1">You got the time to</p>
      <p begin="00:38.695" end="00:40.195" ttm:agent="v1">squander your passion and love</p>
      <p begin="00:39.445" end="00:40.945" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:39.695" end="00:41.945" ttm:agent="v1">不用再讲废话 配合他倒时差</p>
      <p begin="00:41.945" end="00:45.133" ttm:agent="v1">You got a</p>
      <p begin="00:45.133" end="00:46.633" ttm:agent="v1">You got a chance to store memories and the past</p>
      <p begin="00:45.633" end="00:47.133" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:46.133" end="00:49.133" ttm:agent="v1">诗人明白 爱是灵魂交流的平台</p>
      <p begin="00:49.133" end="00:50.633" ttm:agent="v1">而我只爱圣代</p>
      <p begin="00:50.383" end="00:53.133" ttm:agent="v1">诗里的钻石海 没我词写得精彩</p>
      <p begin="00:53.133" end="00:56.132" ttm:agent="v1">没收到令牌而我离开火星不请自来</p>
      <p begin="00:56.132" end="00:57.632" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:56.883" end="01:02.383" ttm:agent="v1">你和她 相隔十万八千 没法擦肩 但爱不踩急刹</p>
      <p begin="01:02.383" end="01:07.633" ttm:agent="v1">其他 穿过篱笆 被她看在眼里 都被分为了 臭鱼臭虾</p>
      <p begin="01:07.633" end="01:09.133" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:08.133" end="01:10.882" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:10.882" end="01:13.633" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:13.633" end="01:16.633" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:16.633" end="01:18.633" ttm:agent="v1">what does the meaning of &quot;fall in love&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:18.633" end="01:20.133" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:19.133" end="01:23.633" ttm:agent="v1">forget how much they paid for it.</p>
      <p begin="01:23.633" end="01:26.383" ttm:agent="v1">像是卫星加速坠落</p>
      <p begin="01:26.383" end="01:30.382" ttm:agent="v1">有人引力太大 碰撞 不只是谁的对错</p>
      <p begin="01:30.382" end="01:38.382" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:42.383" end="01:44.133" ttm:agent="v1">It's gonna keep going on</p>
      <p begin="01:44.133" end="01:45.633" ttm:agent="v1">war gonna keep going on</p>
      <p begin="01:45.133" end="01:46.633" ttm:agent="v1">frustration gonna keep going on</p>
      <p begin="01:46.384" end="01:47.884" ttm:agent="v1">anger gonna keep going on</p>
      <p begin="01:47.884" end="01:51.882" ttm:agent="v1">'til we finally go back down to the simplest word:</p>
      <p begin="01:51.882" end="01:53.382" ttm:agent="v1">LOVE</p>
      <p begin="01:52.633" end="01:54.133" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:53.133" end="01:56.884" ttm:agent="v1">每一页都写满“young blood” like flower bud</p>
      <p begin="01:56.884" end="01:59.565" ttm:agent="v1">even take the drug</p>
      <p begin="01:59.565" end="02:03.315" ttm:agent="v1">真心 服下</p>
      <p begin="02:03.315" end="02:06.065" ttm:agent="v1">【JOY①】不变卦 从咽下 问起</p>
      <p begin="02:06.065" end="02:07.565" ttm:agent="v1">how about love</p>
      <p begin="02:06.816" end="02:08.816" ttm:agent="v1">how about love</p>
      <p begin="02:08.816" end="02:11.565" ttm:agent="v1">how about love</p>
      <p begin="02:11.565" end="02:19.565" ttm:agent="v1">how about love</p>
      <p begin="02:19.745" end="02:21.245" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:20.495" end="02:21.995" ttm:agent="v1">how about love</p>
      <p begin="02:20.996" end="02:22.745" ttm:agent="v1">how about fall in love with a touch</p>
      <p begin="02:22.745" end="02:24.245" ttm:agent="v1">夜晚的光 寂静的道</p>
      <p begin="02:24.245" end="02:26.245" ttm:agent="v1">we may feel bad bad and sick of love</p>
      <p begin="02:26.245" end="02:27.995" ttm:agent="v1">we need the money we got the bill</p>
      <p begin="02:27.995" end="02:29.745" ttm:agent="v1">wake up my body 没时间投降</p>
      <p begin="02:29.745" end="02:31.245" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:29.745" end="02:32.245" ttm:agent="v1">继续再shake it shake it</p>
      <p begin="02:32.245" end="02:33.996" ttm:agent="v1">音乐都不停的切</p>
      <p begin="02:33.996" end="02:35.745" ttm:agent="v1">我们的时间，take it</p>
      <p begin="02:35.745" end="02:37.245" ttm:agent="v1">花谢了还有绿叶</p>
      <p begin="02:37.245" end="02:41.495" ttm:agent="v1">理智喊mayday mayday，但不是今天</p>
      <p begin="02:41.495" end="02:44.995" ttm:agent="v1">EARFQUAKE②,EARFQUAKE,HAPPEN IN MY MIND YA</p>
      <p begin="02:44.995" end="02:46.495" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:45.245" end="02:49.245" ttm:agent="v1">BAY</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
